&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain and improve CI/CD pipelines for application and infrastructure deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Software Engineering teams to improve deployment processes, release reliability and developer workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise containerised workloads using Docker, Kubernetes or similar technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement monitoring, logging and alerting to improve infrastructure visibility, reliability and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide EMEA-based operational coverage and collaborate with DevOps and Engineering teams across regions to support platform reliability and continuity of operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues across cloud infrastructure, applications, networking and deployment pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve infrastructure security, access controls, secrets management and configuration standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop automation and tooling using Python, Bash or similar scripting languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve platform scalability, performance, resilience and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture reviews, incident response and post-incident improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear technical documentation, runbooks and operational procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted engineering tools such as Claude, ChatGPT, GitHub Copilot or similar platforms to improve scripting, troubleshooting, technical research, documentation and workflow efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
